  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 505.02 Application, Data Required.\n\n(a) Each applicant for a motor carrier registration shall furnish the following on the prescribed form:\n\n(1) Name, mailing address, and legal address;\n\n(2) Carrier unit number;\n\n(3) The vehicle's year, make, model, gross weight, and vehicle identification number;\n\n(4) Motor vehicle registration number; and\n\n(5) Signature of the applicant.\n\n(b) The application form shall be submitted, in person to a substation or, in person or by mail, to:\n\nThe Division of Motor Vehicles\n\n23 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord N.H. 03305.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); amd by #8999, eff 9-29-07; amd by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
